WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.690
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.030
They're all so cute!

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.410
Nice. It makes me want to get some autumn clothes.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.660
In that case, why don't we all go shopping this weekend?

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.540
Sure!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.910
Oh, but this weekend...

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.620
What?

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.880
My Little Heart is holding their Autumn Collection.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.340
I'd forgotten.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.420
They must be revealing their new Premium Rare Dress there.{by the way the word for debut is primiere, not primierright}

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.380
Yeah, I'm pretty sure.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.010
I can't help but admire those special dresses that only S4 can wear.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.770
They're one-of-a-kind, made to order.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.730
I'm so hyped up I can't contain my excitement!

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.770
Can I come along?

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:49.110
That gets me going!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.610
Yeah, let's all go together!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.380
All that Collection talk got me in the mood for a Dress Make.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.050
What kind of dress should I make today...

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.390
Yume-chan!

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.930
Hime-senpai.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.270
It's my first time on the second floor.{wow, the world of idols is megas stratified}

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.730
Here for Dress Make?{dress make will ever a noun}

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.650
I was just up here thinking about dresses too.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.940
You mean for the Collection?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:56.650
Yes.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.780
Wow! I'm really looking forward to it!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.160
What kind of dress will it be?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.160
To be honest, it's not finalized yet.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.080
Huh?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.370
I'm about to head off to a design meeting. There, we'll make the final decision.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.750
Cold!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.290
That meeting...

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.460
I have come to express my desire to attend.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.050
Lily-senpai!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.470
When did you get here?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:23.300
For a chance to observe the conception of a Premium Rare Dress,

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.810
I, Shirogane Lily, would brave the hottest flames...

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.770
And the deepest depths...

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.690
Are you okay?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.440
We would be glad to have you.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.900
Could I come too?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.400
Yes, of course.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.660
It's huge.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.450
This is the core of My Little Heart.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.950
Let's head in.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:50.790
Okay!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.830
As we discussed previously,

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:58.590
the season theme for Autumn 2016 is "girly antique".

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.840
The concept is "unforgettable memories".

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.840
From the several designs we have based on that...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:10.020
That's amazing. She's being so forward in giving all of her opinions to adults.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.230
But of course.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.730
She is the founder of the My Little Heart brand.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.860
The founder?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.650
You weren't aware?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.070
Well...

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.860
At Four Star Academy, when one is inducted into S4,

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.280
they receive their own image brand.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.870
I know that much.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:34.710
In most cases, an existing brand makes an offer to appoint the new member as their muse.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:35.880
For example,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.050
Kisaragi Tsubasa-senpai belongs to the cool Spice Chord.{so like, it would make sense for all proper words like "cool" to be capitalized, but that would make it look like "Cool Spice Chord" is a thing, so...}

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.720
Yuzu is with the pop Shiny Smile.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.760
And Kasumi Yozora-senpai represents the sexy Romance Kiss.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.640
However, Shiratori Hime-senpai did not partner with a brand,

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.900
instead deciding to create her own. And that is...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.190
My Little Heart.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:02.940
Yes. It is a brand as elegant and lovely as Hime-senpai herself.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.530
You're making me like My Little Heart even more.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:12.200
Everyone, I know we're facing a large time crunch,

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.960
but let's make this work together.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.710
Time to eat!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.460
It's so good!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.470
I feel refreshed.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.510
Lily-senpai, is that enough for you?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.970
Perfectly so.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.470
More importantly,

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.810
please tell me about the dress's design.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.100
We have a few candidates drawn up.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.110
They're wonderful!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:45.070
I agree, but we're still a bit lost on what to do.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.360
Huh? So even you get lost sometimes, Hime-senpai.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.620
It's only natural when faced with the infinite possibilities of dresses.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.370
Infinite possibilities...

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.080
A dress to make people smile.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.510
What is most important to keep in mind when creating a dress?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.630
That was Hime-senpai's answer when last I questioned her.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:15.890
That's right. I want everyone who sees my Premium Rare Dresses to smile.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:22.480
I wish to make a dress that is loved by all.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:27.860
But Lily-chan, I'm surprised you remembered what I said.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.780
I could never forget.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.410
My ambition is to found a brand myself.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:39.040
Huh? Lily-senpai, you want to create your own brand?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:44.000
To create an original brand of dresses crafted from my heart's love.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.130
That is my reason for wanting to join S4.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.640
Wow, that's amazing.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.510
Yume-chan, what would you want to do in S4?

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.890
I want to be just like you. {I hate how they're using S4 as this sort of noun}

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.940
I'll make everyone smile just like you,

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.860
and be loved by everyone just like you,

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.410
and just like you—

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.410
Yume-chan!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:17.080
I'm glad to hear how much you look up to me. However...

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.710
Is that really what you want?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.090
I'm sorry I can't accompany you back.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:29.010
I have a singing program to record for.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.220
It's fine. Good luck.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.640
Have a nice day.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:40.810
Why would Hime-senpai ask me that?

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.730
You don't understand?

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:48.820
I have never encountered a person with such a goal in my life.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:55.870
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.370
What does everyone else want to do in S4?

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:05.500
Isn't that obvious? I'm gonna make it into US4!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.380
US4?

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:14.050
I'll be the master of both song and dance, the Ultra S4!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.390
That's so cool!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.390
I only have a single goal.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.150
To surpass my sister!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:33.110
I want to be a different kind of 
top model than Kasumi Yozora.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.070
Respect! {I'm taking suggestionsprobably just "Osu!" honestly}

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.530
Respect!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.780
<b>Anne of Green Gables</b>

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.780
Why are you asking that at this point?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:42.160
You're in Theater Class, so I guess you want to be a star actress?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.290
What else could it be?

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.250
Isn't this...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:54.050
I-I am most certainly not aiming for S4 just to have the chance to act alongside Subaru-kyun.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.300
I wasn't thinking anything like that.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:00.310
Enough lies! Your thoughts are written all over your face!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.310
What I want to do in S4?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:14.400
Let's see... I just wanted to be like Yozora-senpai.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.860
But not anymore.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:22.580
Now I want to find what makes me unique.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.580
So you too...

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.920
There's a lot we need to think about.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.210
Goodnight, Yume-chan.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.420
Goodnight.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.800
<i>Everyone else has thought this through.</i>

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.890
Have a good night.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.350
Hey!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.190
Good evening. Were you recording?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.240
Yeah. You too?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.740
Yes. Are you waiting for your ride?

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.450
Would you like to go back to the academy with me?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.410
Thanks, that'd be great.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.910
Please feel free to come if you have the time.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.420
Thanks.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.500
Oh, that reminds me. There's something I've been meaning to ask.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.750
About what?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:18.380
So boiled octo—I mean, Nijino... what was it again?

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.300
Yume-chan?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.930
Yeah, that! Sometimes she has these unbelievable performances, right?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.020
I suppose so.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:29.270
She's way more amazing than I expected.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:33.520
It's like she's performing above her actual ability.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.990
Didn't something like that happen to you back in your first year too?

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.780
Oh, we're here.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.120
Good night.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.000
You too.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.250
Well, I guess I can ask at her event.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:02.050
Yuuki Subaru, I have a request.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.180
A request?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:21.070
Hello, I'm Nijino Yume!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:23.990
My dream is to join S4!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:29.250
Okay. Now tell us what you're looking to do once you make it in!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:34.000
Um, well, I want to be just like Shiratori Hime-senpai in S4.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.010
Isn't that good enough?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.640
Nijino, don't listen to what people say! {just wait five lines before changing thisI waited, and now I'm changing it}

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.060
Nijino...

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.350
Nijino!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.020
S-Sorry!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.940
Listen when someone's talking to you.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.440
But you just told me not to.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.650
What did I say?

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.980
N-Never mind.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.490
I have no idea what's going on anymore.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.700
Why don't you just stop thinking about it?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.660
Huh?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:10.160
I don't think this is something you're supposed to figure out with your head.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.540
Is that just how it is?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.630
That's how it looks to me, at least.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.300
I know!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.050
It might be interesting to do some research on past S4 members.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.550
Was this one of the first people in S4?

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:31.560
They say her singing voice sounded like a fleeting shooting star. {I had "songs" originally but it didn't quite fit}

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.980
She does have this cute, fleeting look about her.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.560
Wait...

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.440
Isn't that Anna-sensei?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.070
It says she was known as the Nova of Rock.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.700
Isn't that Tamagorou-sensei?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.620
No, her name is Tamae-san.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.660
She was a model who influenced the Paris Collection.{no PariColle?}

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.620
So beautiful!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.670
Momoko-sensei was the first graduate to land a lead part in a Hollywood film.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.420
And then, there's the current S4.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.970
Looking at them all together makes their individuality stand out more.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:11.100
I doubt you'll find anyone in the S4 history books who wanted to be like someone else.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.110
Come in.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.990
I'm sorry for coming so late.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.000
I don't mind.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.000
You have so many books.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.880
What brings you here at this late hour?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:45.130
Lily-senpai, what inspired you to want to create your own original brand?

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.140
What do you intend to do with my answer?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:53.890
I always thought that I wanted to be like Hime-senpai when I got into S4.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.900
But now I know that I can't just do that.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:02.520
So I'm completely lost on what I want out of S4.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.330
It began with a moment of fate.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.660
Fate?

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.920
Yes.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.750
That night, I felt the touch of fate.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:30.010
Perhaps it was Yuzu's whim, or else carefully orchestrated,

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:35.140
but in any case, Yuzu brought to me a book.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:44.070
The very instant I gazed upon its dresses, a bolt of lightning ran through my body,

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.490
my heart inextricably entranced.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:52.620
I wished to stand on stage in dresses made with my heart's love.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:57.830
That is why I want to create an original brand.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.830
I still feel it vividly.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:06.090
If Yuzu had not brought me this book, I would not be here today.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.800
Yes, that was undoubtedly fate.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.430
Whether you accept or deny your fate is up to you.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.520
There are so many people.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.440
Yep!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:33.370
It's finally time to raise the curtain at My Little Heart's Autumn Collection!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:38.540
First are the Rare Dresses.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.130
They're so cool!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.760
That dress is really cute!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.800
It's nice!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:03.060
Now, let's bring out the muse of 
My Little Heart, Shiratori Hime-san!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.820
Hello, everyone. I'm Shiratori Hime.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:15.320
I'm so happy to see all of you here.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.530
I'm happy too!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:24.580
Whenever it comes time to create a 
new dress, I always picture your smiles.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:31.130
When you're suffering or sad, 
lost or lacking self-confidence,

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:35.590
if seeing my dresses can bring a smile to your face,

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.600
I can think of nothing that makes me happier.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.600
Hime-senpai.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:50.480
This is the Premium Rare Dress I pulled from the depths of infinite possibilities.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.240
Please enjoy.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:02.870
The Secret Diary Coord, expressing the feelings locked inside my heart.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.380
Shiratori Hime, ready to go!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.890
Hime-senpai and her dress were both awesome!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.020
A smile just floated to my face.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:13.480
Hime-senpai really is amazing.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.350
That she is.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:16.730
Lily-senpai?! When did you get here?{what happened to her cold aura?}

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.990
Hime-senpai truly is fantastic.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.700
Yes, that's why I always looked up to her.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.740
But...

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:31.000
Hime-senpai is Hime-senpai, and I'm me, right?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:41.010
I guess this is the power of a Premium Rare Dress.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.890
A weight appears to have been lifted from your shoulders, Nijino-san.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.310
Yes, thank you so much for your help.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.270
I can't take credit...

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.310
So she's here too.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:54.350
Yo, Toma—

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.900
Yuuki Subaru.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.690
I have a request.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.150
A request?

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:04.910
Could you not dig any deeper than you have?

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.870
What do you mean?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.160
Regarding Nijino Yume.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.290
I'm not really...

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:18.040
All of this is for Nijino's sake.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.550
Please do as I ask.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.680
Yume, that was a pretty cool line.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.600
Something happen?

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.930
What do you think?

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.560
What?

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.810
It's secret!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:34.810
Girls.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.190
Thank you for coming today.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:43.190
Hime-senpai! Your Premium Rare Dress was super lovely!

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.740
It has become an unforgettable memory.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.070
Thank you.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:52.450
I won't talk about wanting to be like you ever again.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:57.460
I'm going to think hard about what I personally want from S4.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.380
That's good to hear.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.840
I'm still a bit unsure though.

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.630
Were it Miguel de Cervantes, he would say,

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:11.470
"When one door closes, another opens." {this translation is of course Alexander Graham Bellthat sounds photoshopped}

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.470
Yume-san.

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:18.480
You will find a new goal to strive toward.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.480
That's what I believe.

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:21.480
Me too.

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:24.070
Right!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:11.720
Happy Halloween!

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:14.390
Whoever gets the most candy wins!

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:17.180
My Felicitaiyaki puts me one step in the lead!{wasn't it "Felici-taiyaki"?}

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:18.640
No fair, Rola!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.730
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:22.020
Halloween Magic.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.350
